{"_meta":{"com.oxinsider/docs-group":"games","securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["read"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get fair price"},"description":"The Polymarket fair price of one game outcome, to price a sportsbook bet against: the outcome's cached best bid, best ask, midpoint, spread in cents and USD resting within 2 cents of the midpoint on each side, the taker fee a buy at the ask pays, and fair.prob, the midpoint normalised over the market's outcomes (a soccer 1X2 leg over the three Yes midpoints). Name the outcome by condition_id and outcome, or by event_slug, market_type and outcome_label (plus line for a spread or total).\n\nArgs:\n  - condition_id (string): the market's condition id; send with outcome\n  - outcome (number): 0 or 1, the outcome index\n  - event_slug (string): the game, as list_games returns it; send with market_type and outcome_label\n  - market_type (string): moneyline, spread or total\n  - outcome_label (string): the outcome's label as the market lists it, ignoring case, for example Commanders or Over\n  - line (number): the exact line of a spread or total; required for those, refused for a moneyline\n  - max_spread_c (number, above 0 and at most 100, default 3): the widest spread in cents that passes\n  - min_book_usd_within_2c (number, 1-10,000,000, default 500): the USD each side must hold within 2 cents of the midpoint\n\nReturns: data with status (ok, wide_spread, thin_book, stale_quote, closed or unavailable), failed_checks, the outcome, quote, fee (basis observed, disabled or assumed), fair (prob, prob_mid, decimal_odds, american_odds), game (start, started), the thresholds applied and as_of. Read status before using fair.prob: anything but ok means the midpoint is not fit to price a bet. A value the cache does not hold is null, never 0.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"condition_id":{"description":"The marke